.direnv/**

# Beads is machine-local in this repo, as it is everywhere else. Nothing under
# `.beads/` is tracked — not the db, not its locks, and not `issues.jsonl`.
# Tracking the export was tried here (see the CLAUDE.md note) and reverted: br
# reimports from that file, so a copy pulled from another machine can silently
# revert a close, and every mutation on two machines is a whole-file conflict in
# a file no one reads by hand.
.beads/**
.abacus/**
